## CatalogFeedsApi

### List feed processing results
## List feed processing results
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/feeds/{{feed_id}}/processing_results?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Create feed
## Create feed
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/feeds?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}


### Delete feed
## Delete feed
DELETE https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/feeds/{{feed_id}}?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### Get feed
## Get feed
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/feeds/{{feed_id}}?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### Ingest feed items
## Ingest feed items
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/feeds/{{feed_id}}/ingest?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### List feeds
## List feeds
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/feeds?catalogId={{catalogId}}&adAccountId={{adAccountId}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Update feed
## Update feed
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/feeds/{{feed_id}}?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}


### List item issues
## List item issues
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/processing_results/{{processing_result_id}}/item_issues?itemNumbers={{itemNumbers}}&itemValidationIssue={{itemValidationIssue}}&adAccountId={{adAccountId}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json
